<title>USA: Ultrak Inc buys Casarotto Security SpA.</title>
<headline>Ultrak Inc buys Casarotto Security SpA.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLTON, Texas 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrak Inc said it has purchased 100 percent of the stock of Italy's Casarotto Security SpA.</p>
<p>A purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
